        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "Trail Ribbon Rendering\n\nTrailRibbonSOP records particle positions each frame into a ring buffer,\nthen builds ribbon geometry with proper normals, UVs, and alpha fade.\n\nSourcePOP emits \u2192 ForcePOP adds gravity \u2192 TrailRibbonSOP builds ribbons.\n\nParameters:\n\u2022 trail_length: frames of history (longer = longer ribbons)\n\u2022 width: ribbon half-width\n\u2022 taper: 0 = uniform width, 1 = full taper to tip\n\u2022 fade_alpha: old trail fades transparent\n\u2022 max_particles: cap for performance",
            "position": [
